<title>CANADA: Canada body details Extra Strong Wheat protein.</title>
<headline>Canada body details Extra Strong Wheat protein.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Grain Commission on Monday detailed the protein content of Canada Western Extra Strong Wheat.</p>
<p>			   No1 CWES</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Manitoba	 152	12.9     11.1  15.2</p>
<p>Saskatchewan   308	11.9	8.9  15.0</p>
<p>Alberta	   87	12.0	8.3  16.6</p>
<p>W. Canada	547	12.2	8.3  16.6</p>
<p>			   No2 CWES</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Manitoba	  16	13.0     11.4  14.5</p>
<p>Saskatchewan    35	12.2	9.4  14.7</p>
<p>Alberta	   38	11.7	9.9  14.4</p>
<p>W. Canada	 89	12.1	9.4  14.7</p>
<p>			   CW FEED</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Manitoba	  25	12.8     11.1  14.7</p>
<p>Saskatchewan    12	11.2     10.2  14.2</p>
<p>Alberta	   36	11.1	9.0  13.5</p>
<p>W. Canada	 73	11.7	9.0  14.7</p>
<p>			   ALL GRADES</p>
<p>PROVINCE	SAMPLES   MEAN AVG  MIN. MAX. (PCT)</p>
<p>Manitoba	 193	12.9     11.1  15.2</p>
<p>Saskatchewan   355	11.9	8.9  15.0</p>
<p>Alberta	  161	11.7	8.3  16.6</p>
<p>W. Canada	709	12.2	8.3  16.6</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
